RULE 07
RID IS A SYSTEM IDENTIFIER.

RULE 08
RID IS NOT CLAIMED TO BE A DIVINE TECHNICAL IDENTIFIER.

RULE 09
ONE MODELED PERSON = ONE RID.

RULE 10
CATATAN AMAL IS THE CENTRAL RECORD MODEL.

RULE 11
APPLICATION RECORD != DIVINE RECORD.

RULE 12
