RULE 13
AGE IS NOT AUTOMATIC QUALIFICATION.

RULE 14
MATURITY, JUDGMENT, KNOWLEDGE, CAPABILITY,
TRUSTWORTHINESS, CHARACTER, AND SERVICE
ARE SEPARATE QUALIFICATION DIMENSIONS.

RULE 15
99 IS THE MAXIMUM DEVELOPMENT LEVEL
OF THIS GAMIFICATION SYSTEM.

RULE 16
EACH DEVELOPMENT LEVEL IS BASED ON AN
ASMAUL HUSNA THEME.

RULE 17
A HUMAN DOES NOT "BECOME" A DIVINE NAME.

RULE 18
ASMA LEVEL = DEVELOPMENT THEME,
NOT DIVINE ATTRIBUTE OWNERSHIP.

RULE 19
THE 99-LEVEL ORDER MUST HAVE A DATASET VERSION.

RULE 20
TIRMIDHI 3507 MAY BE USED AS AN INITIAL
EXPLICIT 99-NAME DATASET.

RULE 21
THE NINETY-NINE COUNT AND THE EXACT
ORDERED LIST MUST REMAIN CONCEPTUALLY DISTINCT.

RULE 22
ASMA MASTERY IS NOT DIVINE ACCEPTANCE.

RULE 23
GAME LEVEL MUST REMAIN SEPARATE FROM AKHIRAT DEGREE.

RULE 24
AKHIRAT DEGREE IS A MODELLED CONCEPT,
NOT AN INVENTED REVEALED NUMBER SCALE.

RULE 25
THE TOP-LEVEL OUTCOME CLASSES ARE JANNAH
AND JAHANNAM IN THE MODELED ESCHATOLOGICAL OUTPUT.

RULE 26
DURING LIFE, FINAL OUTCOME = NOT_FINAL.

RULE 27
NO HEAVEN SCORE.

RULE 28
NO HELL SCORE.

RULE 29
NO PUBLIC PIETY LEADERBOARD.

RULE 30
NO GUARANTEED-SALVATION BADGE.

RULE 31
SEVEN GATES OF JAHANNAM MAY BE REPRESENTED
BECAUSE THE SOURCE EXPLICITLY STATES SEVEN.

RULE 32
GATE NUMBER MUST NOT AUTOMATICALLY EQUAL DEGREE.

RULE 33
LOWEST DEPTH MUST BE RESERVED FOR SOURCE-SUPPORTED CASES.

RULE 34
NO UNSUPPORTED PERSONAL PUNISHMENT TIMER.

RULE 35
50,000 YEARS MUST NOT BE USED AS
A PERSONAL HELL SENTENCE.

RULE 36
ETERNITY IS USED ONLY WHEN THE
RELEVANT SOURCE CATEGORY SUPPORTS IT.

RULE 37
ALL DECISIONS MUST BE AUDITABLE.

RULE 38
EVERY PROGRAMMATIC SCORE MUST HAVE
AN EXPLICIT MEANING.

RULE 39
NO PROGRAM OUTPUT MAY PRETEND TO BE
THE ACTUAL UNSEEN.

RULE 40
THE SOURCE LAYER MUST NOT BE MODIFIED
TO MAKE THE SOFTWARE LOOK SYMMETRICAL.

RULE 41
INTERPRETATION MAY EVOLVE WITHOUT
REWRITING THE SOURCE.

RULE 42
IMPLEMENTATION MAY EVOLVE WITHOUT
REWRITING THE SOURCE.

RULE 43
THE 99-LEVEL CURRICULUM ENDS AT LEVEL 99.

RULE 44
LEVEL 99 MEANS CURRICULUM COMPLETE,
NOT HUMAN PERFECTION.

RULE 45
THE PURPOSE OF GAMIFICATION IS DEVELOPMENT,
REFLECTION, SERVICE, RESPONSIBILITY,
AND SELF-CORRECTION.
```

